        "title": "data race in TimeZone causes data-index inconsistency ",
        "body": "## Bug Report\r\n\r\nPlease answer these questions before submitting your issue. Thanks!\r\n\r\n### 1. Minimal reproduce step (Required)\r\n\r\n<!-- a step by step guide for reproducing the bug. -->\r\nSince data race is very hard to reproduce, I will show how it happens in theory.\r\n\r\n```\r\nupdate:\r\n    |\r\n    |----  update one row (use sc.timezone to encode row)\r\n    |\r\nChildExec (in SetPBColumnsDefaultValue(), set sc.timezone = UTC)\r\n```\r\n\r\n Here is the test case:\r\n```\r\nfunc TestTimezoneDataRace(t *testing.T) {\r\n\tstore := testkit.CreateMockStore(t)\r\n\r\n\ttk := testkit.NewTestKit(t, store)\r\n\ttk.MustExec(\"use test\")\r\n\ttk.MustExec(\"CREATE TABLE `c1de839f-4305-4edc-b6bf-463b5890430c` (\\n  `1340b953-044b-4cc2-81b7-ed153ade630e` float DEFAULT '1.0469099',\\n  `de3381af-3319-4035-985e-a83296fbe929` enum('s059b','f','nt','37n5','9w9pd','omp3m','b','8uwfd','1sv7l','x7j9n','ky8') DEFAULT '1sv7l',\\n  `a9b6435c-43a2-4370-9256-eb8b64a590eb` smallint(6) DEFAULT '-10093',\\n  `ffbf71c5-8559-40f1-a1f8-5e5e03e69abd` time DEFAULT '08:08:53',\\n  `31a80f0f-4b8c-4171-9f06-8d191842541f` decimal(54,22) DEFAULT '84447970762009522232772614140425.0705348716771117376820',\\n  `54bac6a1-ada5-436a-8c13-bc6ab738db46` bigint(20) DEFAULT '6183436475535305164',\\n  `c37f63a0-7802-48bb-ba0b-7b4c5e2b8097` char(255) DEFAULT 'uv9qaoowi3d2w5po2d5224fm4rmp5o5turz1db1iimcyv8fu8b5kyturpwvvat73ty8oi9qnp76pres1drv9',\\n  KEY `89566a55-2db4-4cc0-a094-15d1b09cfa45` (`a9b6435c-43a2-4370-9256-eb8b64a590eb`),\\n  KEY `981dd6c3-b1ea-415a-adcf-c84b5432e2ab` (`1340b953-044b-4cc2-81b7-ed153ade630e`),\\n  KEY `0d7536fc-4f27-4285-919f-b069a1546ca8` (`a9b6435c-43a2-4370-9256-eb8b64a590eb`,`1340b953-044b-4cc2-81b7-ed153ade630e`,`54bac6a1-ada5-436a-8c13-bc6ab738db46`),\\n  KEY `4669c9be-7118-452d-84a2-0213edd38536` (`54bac6a1-ada5-436a-8c13-bc6ab738db46`),\\n  KEY `2514744c-9be8-4a49-8b8e-0bf13237665f` (`ffbf71c5-8559-40f1-a1f8-5e5e03e69abd`,`c37f63a0-7802-48bb-b